This is the client, system and elasticsearch servers deployment.

Production stack:

```powershell
docker-compose -f docker-compose.yml up -d
```

Development stack:

```powershell
docker-compose -f docker-compose-dev.yml up --build -d
```

Prefer the wrapper scripts in the repository root `scripts/` directory for day-to-day use:

```powershell
.\scripts\ErpUp.ps1
.\scripts\ErpDevBuildUp.ps1
.\scripts\ErpDevDown.ps1
```
